WEBVTT

00:06.980 --> 00:08.640
Yes?

00:08.640 --> 00:10.900
Good morning, Lady Saint.

00:10.900 --> 00:12.230
I'm coming in.

00:13.760 --> 00:15.280
All right.

00:19.160 --> 00:22.420
Look. The weather is nice again today.

00:22.420 --> 00:25.920
It's cold. I can't leave my bed.

00:25.920 --> 00:28.590
I've made the rooms 
downstairs nice and warm.

00:41.340 --> 00:43.680
I can see Lawren!

00:44.930 --> 00:48.360
H-Hurry up and come downstairs, please.

00:48.360 --> 00:50.320
I will.

00:55.710 --> 00:57.690
<i>Since then, every once in a while...</i>

00:58.250 --> 01:00.670
<i>I don't understand the lady saint.</i>

02:32.290 --> 02:36.010
Episode 11

02:32.290 --> 02:36.010
The Way They Met

02:39.680 --> 02:43.520
Today, I'm supposed to go 
to the church in the afternoon, right?

02:43.520 --> 02:47.300
Maybe I'll go back to sleep 
until the lady summons me.

02:55.690 --> 02:57.280
Good morning, Abel.

02:57.280 --> 02:58.650
What is it?

02:58.650 --> 03:01.530
I've had my studying things sent here.

03:01.530 --> 03:04.490
I just thought I'd have 
you help me unpack them.

03:04.490 --> 03:06.270
I don't mind,

03:06.270 --> 03:08.880
but every time you pound 
on the wall to summon me,

03:08.880 --> 03:11.640
things in my room fall down.

03:11.640 --> 03:13.840
They fall down in my room, too!

03:13.840 --> 03:16.050
That means you should knock on the <i>door.</i>

03:16.680 --> 03:18.290
Those two...

03:18.290 --> 03:23.170
I wonder if our absence
has allowed them to grow any closer.

03:23.170 --> 03:24.290
No idea.

03:24.290 --> 03:27.520
They're just going back 
to the way things were, after all.

03:28.140 --> 03:30.440
That's it! That face!

03:30.890 --> 03:35.040
Whenever I speak about those 
two this way, you make that face.

03:35.040 --> 03:36.240
What?

03:36.240 --> 03:40.480
I know that it isn't something that 
the people around them should meddle in,

03:40.480 --> 03:44.030
but I can't help wondering if you don't 
really care what happens to them.

03:44.030 --> 03:47.800
I think it's best to leave 
them alone, that's all.

03:47.800 --> 03:50.200
It's something the two of them 
have to figure out anyway.

03:50.200 --> 03:54.040
I do realize that's the best thing to do,

03:54.330 --> 03:59.630
but given it's those two, they may 
still be like this ten years from now.

04:00.380 --> 04:01.830
Are you all right with that?

04:01.830 --> 04:06.080
For your friend to spend ten 
years of his life as a fool?

04:08.000 --> 04:10.010
<i>When I really think about it...</i>

04:10.010 --> 04:13.490
<i>if those two stay together 
like this for years,</i>

04:13.490 --> 04:17.030
<i>Saint Cecilia will keep 
protecting Lawrence...</i>

04:17.900 --> 04:20.520
<i>I think that'd be just fine.</i>

04:20.820 --> 04:22.850
<i>It'd be fine, but...</i>

04:22.850 --> 04:27.200
<i>But that isn't really what 
Saint Cecilia is hoping for.</i>

04:27.200 --> 04:28.620
<i>Guess there's no helping it.</i>

04:28.960 --> 04:31.450
<i>Maybe I'll try stepping in.</i>

04:34.080 --> 04:37.080
Oh, come on. If you're here, then help out.

04:37.080 --> 04:39.060
First, I'm having a cup of tea.

04:39.060 --> 04:40.440
Honestly.

04:40.440 --> 04:44.060
Well, I did come here to take a break, 
so I can't be upset with you.

04:44.060 --> 04:46.000
Oh, those sweets...

04:46.000 --> 04:49.640
Earlier, Saint Cecilia was eating them 
while sparkling and spinning around.

04:49.640 --> 04:52.020
Is that how she sneaks snacks?

04:52.610 --> 04:56.010
Please don't tell the congregation 
about things like that.

04:57.650 --> 04:59.680
Oh, right. Lawrence?

04:59.680 --> 05:04.170
I heard that you called Saint Cecilia 
by name in the town to the west.

05:04.690 --> 05:06.110
H-How do you...

05:06.110 --> 05:08.980
Mister Giselbert told me 
with quite a smug look on his face.

05:09.680 --> 05:11.160
That man...

05:11.160 --> 05:15.550
W-Well, I can't call her 
"Lady Saint" in other towns, can I?

05:15.550 --> 05:18.420
You have no hesitation 
at all in entering her room,

05:18.420 --> 05:21.420
so why is it that you dislike 
the idea of calling her by name so much?

05:21.420 --> 05:24.420
It isn't that I don't 
want to call her by name.

05:24.420 --> 05:29.300
Ever since we first met, 
I've been calling her Lady Saint, so...

05:29.300 --> 05:31.490
Calling her by name 
after all this time is...

05:31.490 --> 05:33.310
Well, it's embarrassing, isn't it?

05:33.310 --> 05:38.330
I've never understood you, 
but I understand you even less now.

05:38.820 --> 05:41.800
The lady herself is happy 
when you call her by name, isn't she?

05:41.800 --> 05:44.950
I-I told her that I'd work hard 
at calling her by name.

05:44.950 --> 05:49.620
I do want to do things 
that will make the lady saint happy.

05:50.440 --> 05:52.900
What are you making me say right now?

05:51.470 --> 05:56.420
<i>He didn't used to be the type to fret 
over things like this.</i>

05:53.720 --> 05:56.970
But if it makes 
the lady saint happy, then...

05:56.970 --> 06:00.090
<i>The fact that he's different now...</i>

06:00.090 --> 06:06.080
<i>probably means that his meeting Saint Cecilia 
was a big moment in his life.</i>

06:06.080 --> 06:08.210
You've changed.

06:08.210 --> 06:10.230
I can't say I enjoy being 
told that out of nowhere.

06:10.240 --> 06:11.760
In fact, it's irritating.

06:14.230 --> 06:16.680
This is where you two were!

06:16.680 --> 06:19.030
Abel, are you slacking off again?

06:19.030 --> 06:20.400
I'm taking a break.

06:20.400 --> 06:23.160
I've just made tea. Would you like some?

06:23.680 --> 06:25.790
I'll have some! I'll take a break now!

06:25.790 --> 06:27.690
I'll have some, too.

06:27.690 --> 06:31.180
Lady Saint, please snack only in moderation.

06:31.990 --> 06:35.100
But they just looked so delicious!

06:36.830 --> 06:40.710
Wait up! You're too fast!

06:38.400 --> 06:40.710
So, how did it go?

06:42.200 --> 06:44.960
Did you have a proper talk with Lawrence?

06:44.960 --> 06:48.520
It seems like he's trying 
hard in his own way.

06:48.520 --> 06:49.210
What?

06:49.550 --> 06:52.960
I'm not interested in pestering 
someone who's trying hard,

06:52.960 --> 06:56.390
so I'm going to stick to just 
watching over them after all.

06:56.390 --> 06:57.800
What? What do you—

06:57.800 --> 06:59.190
Pastor Abel!

06:59.190 --> 07:00.140
Coming!

07:00.450 --> 07:01.920
Hold on!

07:02.290 --> 07:03.860
Honestly.

07:04.400 --> 07:08.310
Ce... Ce... Ceci...

07:09.580 --> 07:10.860
I can't do it.

07:10.860 --> 07:16.600
And I can't imagine the sight of the lady saint 
being happy because I called her by name.

07:16.890 --> 07:20.860
She seems happier when she's eating scones.

07:21.220 --> 07:24.880
She was happy the first time 
she ate them, wasn't she?

07:23.600 --> 07:25.700
Oh, please wait.

07:26.370 --> 07:28.270
Over here, Lady Saint! Hurry up!

07:26.370 --> 07:30.760
<i>Ever since we met, 
she's always been the lady saint.</i>

07:32.760 --> 07:35.900
Let's see. The next place 
I'll be visiting is...

07:35.900 --> 07:39.070
Please listen!

07:39.070 --> 07:41.520
Won't anyone please destroy this bridge?

07:41.520 --> 07:45.020
When the heavy rains come, 
terrible things will happen.

07:45.020 --> 07:46.110
Please!

07:46.110 --> 07:47.110
Rain?

07:47.110 --> 07:50.330
That girl has been doing that for hours now.

07:50.330 --> 07:52.730
Do you think we should 
call someone over about it?

07:53.090 --> 07:54.950
Excuse me, you—

07:54.950 --> 07:56.530
Pastor!

07:57.160 --> 07:59.200
So this is where you are!

07:59.200 --> 08:00.660
My mom is waiting for you.

08:00.660 --> 08:02.210
Oh! I'm sorry.

08:02.210 --> 08:04.540
She said she baked some sweets today.

08:04.530 --> 08:05.660
I see.

08:06.790 --> 08:08.710
E-Excuse me?

08:09.000 --> 08:10.380
Pastor?

08:10.380 --> 08:11.830
Y-Yes.

08:16.480 --> 08:21.050
<i>I don't think there's any record 
of heavy rains in this village.</i>

08:23.720 --> 08:25.040
This is...

08:25.890 --> 08:29.240
Then, won't it turn out 
just as that girl said?

08:38.200 --> 08:39.910
I thought so!

08:39.910 --> 08:43.300
We might really get heavy rains here.

08:46.460 --> 08:48.420
<i>If a huge amount of rain does fall...</i>

08:48.420 --> 08:51.860
<i>and sediment and large trees are swept 
from the mountains into the village...</i>

08:52.720 --> 08:56.050
Who could that girl possibly be?

08:56.470 --> 09:00.340
Lady saints protect the people.

09:01.130 --> 09:02.440
Could it be?

09:03.640 --> 09:07.190
Please. Please destroy this bridge.

09:07.190 --> 09:08.780
You say that,

09:08.780 --> 09:12.180
but this is a peaceful village 
where we don't get flood damage.

09:12.180 --> 09:14.730
More important right now, 
you're swaying on your feet.

09:14.730 --> 09:15.690
Are you all right?

09:15.690 --> 09:17.880
Don't worry about me.

09:17.880 --> 09:21.450
More important is that 
we're running out of time...

09:22.330 --> 09:23.700
Whoa!

09:23.700 --> 09:25.330
Pastor! Pastor...

09:25.330 --> 09:26.380
Are you all right?

09:26.380 --> 09:27.960
Y-Yes.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.830
You say we're running out of time.

09:29.830 --> 09:31.870
How much do we have left?

09:33.920 --> 09:35.660
U-Um...

09:35.660 --> 09:37.680
As soon as possible, this bridge—

09:38.920 --> 09:40.880
Ow...

09:40.880 --> 09:42.720
You aren't hurt, are you?

09:49.910 --> 09:53.600
Are you... a lady saint?

09:54.530 --> 09:55.600
Yes.

09:56.100 --> 09:59.120
As someone who receives 
divine revelations from God,

09:59.540 --> 10:02.920
I've been led here to save 
this village from calamity.

10:02.920 --> 10:04.250
I am a lady saint.

10:05.250 --> 10:08.240
A lady saint? Did you hear that?

10:08.240 --> 10:09.720
Please, I beg you.

10:08.240 --> 10:11.540
She says she's a lady saint. Is it true?

10:09.720 --> 10:11.540
Please, believe me.

10:11.540 --> 10:13.880
I want to protect this village!

10:16.010 --> 10:17.570
All right.

10:19.110 --> 10:21.400
I believe you.

10:21.400 --> 10:23.220
Let's demolish the bridge.

10:33.230 --> 10:34.730
This way.

10:34.730 --> 10:36.730
It's all right.

10:49.500 --> 10:50.920
Lady Saint!

10:51.370 --> 10:52.820
Is the village...

10:54.710 --> 10:56.250
It's safe!

10:56.250 --> 10:57.620
I'm so glad!

10:58.130 --> 11:00.630
It's because you told us what 
to do, Lady Saint.

11:02.640 --> 11:08.090
I wasn't able to convey anything 
to the people of this village on my own.

11:08.670 --> 11:11.360
This is all thanks to the fact 
that you were here.

11:12.520 --> 11:16.600
Thank you for believing in me.

11:17.740 --> 11:19.870
<i>She'd arrived so suddenly.</i>

11:19.870 --> 11:23.480
<i>Her voice was hoarse from using it 
for the sake of the villagers,</i>

11:23.480 --> 11:26.800
<i>and she was illuminated 
by an angelic glow..</i>

11:27.270 --> 11:29.870
<i>She was exactly what my 
grandpa had told me about.</i>

11:30.630 --> 11:34.780
<i>A lady saint who protects the people.</i>

11:35.880 --> 11:38.870
Pastor! Lady Saint!

11:38.870 --> 11:40.420
Everyone!

11:40.880 --> 11:42.040
The village is safe!

11:43.830 --> 11:45.710
Thank you! It's all 
thanks to you, Lady Saint!

11:45.710 --> 11:48.760
You saved us! You are our village's savior!

11:48.760 --> 11:51.100
Lady Saint, are you going to go home now?

11:51.100 --> 11:53.060
Stay here forever.

11:53.060 --> 11:54.450
I know this is rude of me,

11:54.450 --> 11:56.710
but if you wouldn't mind, 
won't you stay here a little longer?

11:56.710 --> 11:59.950
Yes! We want to repay our debt to you!

11:59.950 --> 12:02.090
Are you going to go home already?

12:02.820 --> 12:06.170
I have nowhere to go home to.

12:07.200 --> 12:08.840
Really?

12:08.840 --> 12:11.420
In that case, why don't you 
live here at this church?

12:11.420 --> 12:12.320
What?

12:12.320 --> 12:17.200
Lady Saint, if you stayed here it would 
be easy for us to come and see you!

12:13.050 --> 12:15.320
This is a nice place!

12:15.320 --> 12:17.720
I think staying here at 
the church would be the best thing!

12:17.200 --> 12:19.440
And the pastor has been looking 
after you here, hasn't he?

12:17.720 --> 12:19.730
That's a wonderful idea!

12:19.440 --> 12:21.220
That's true, but...

12:21.220 --> 12:23.880
I want the lady saint to stay here forever!

12:29.480 --> 12:30.810
There!

12:30.810 --> 12:32.320
Lady Saint?

12:32.320 --> 12:33.930
Y-Yes?

12:33.930 --> 12:37.440
I've made a snack. Would you like some?

12:40.810 --> 12:43.570
What is this snack called?

12:43.570 --> 12:45.150
They're scones.

12:45.150 --> 12:47.140
Scones.

12:47.140 --> 12:49.080
This is the first time I've eaten them.

12:54.860 --> 12:59.760
<i>Ever since we met, I've tried 
to protect her in my own way.</i>

12:55.780 --> 12:58.540
I like it! What do you think?

13:01.060 --> 13:02.920
It's very cute.

13:01.800 --> 13:05.120
<i>Because she's a lady saint.</i>

13:03.780 --> 13:06.450
What do you think? Look at mine!

13:08.940 --> 13:13.260
<i>But that isn't the only reason... is it?</i>

13:15.560 --> 13:18.970
It's more fun eating together, isn't it?

13:18.970 --> 13:20.700
We went to the trouble of moving out,

13:20.700 --> 13:23.940
but we end up eating here almost every day.

13:24.450 --> 13:26.050
There's nothing wrong with that, is there?

13:26.050 --> 13:27.670
Please come every day!

13:27.670 --> 13:30.530
Since the lady saint says so, please, do!

13:30.530 --> 13:32.110
But you know,

13:32.110 --> 13:35.640
when it's really cold, 
going outside is such a bother.

13:35.640 --> 13:38.540
The cold is very cruel.

13:38.540 --> 13:41.040
Cecilia, you don't like the winter?

13:41.040 --> 13:42.760
You could say I don't like it...

13:42.760 --> 13:45.560
but it's more that I can't come out 
from under the covers in the mornings.

13:45.560 --> 13:49.560
That... isn't just during 
the winter, though, is it?

13:50.390 --> 13:52.560
You're right...

13:52.560 --> 13:53.760
Thanks for the meal.

13:53.760 --> 13:55.090
We'll see you again.

13:55.090 --> 13:56.280
Be careful on your way!

13:56.280 --> 13:57.630
Good night!

14:03.910 --> 14:07.660
Lady Saint, will you come 
with me for a moment?

14:18.920 --> 14:20.940
It's an attic.

14:20.940 --> 14:24.700
It was there? I had no idea.

14:24.700 --> 14:26.700
Climb up, but please be careful.

14:26.700 --> 14:27.890
I will!

14:34.510 --> 14:37.020
I can't move any more...

14:38.770 --> 14:41.020
A memory.

14:45.290 --> 14:47.920
I didn't know there was a room like this.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.870
It isn't used, normally,

14:49.870 --> 14:52.540
but I tidy up in here, so it should be clean.

14:52.540 --> 14:54.040
Really?

14:54.730 --> 14:57.060
But why did you bring me here?

15:03.550 --> 15:06.520
Lawren! The sky! The stars!

15:06.520 --> 15:08.520
They're so beautiful!

15:08.520 --> 15:13.550
Lady Saint, you said 
that the cold is cruel, didn't you?

15:13.550 --> 15:14.460
Yes.

15:14.730 --> 15:20.310
The reason this starry sky is so beautiful 
is because of the cold winter.

15:20.310 --> 15:25.190
I wanted to show you 
that it has a good side to it, too.

15:25.190 --> 15:28.920
I do realize that 
I'm being meddlesome, but I...

15:30.940 --> 15:32.140
Lawren.

15:33.290 --> 15:37.950
I'm largely ignorant of the world.

15:37.950 --> 15:41.760
I lived for so long holed up in that forest,

15:41.760 --> 15:47.700
I had no idea that the sky of the cold, 
cruel winter was this beautiful.

15:50.050 --> 15:55.220
<i>I don't know anything about the lady saint 
from before we met either...</i>

15:55.220 --> 15:57.960
<i>even though we've lived 
together for so long now...</i>

15:57.960 --> 16:00.340
<i>even though I want to protect her.</i>

16:00.970 --> 16:04.720
Lady Saint, will you tell me 
more about yourself?

16:04.720 --> 16:05.930
What?

16:05.930 --> 16:08.480
What's this all of a sudden?

16:08.480 --> 16:11.130
I thought that I'd like to know more.

16:11.130 --> 16:13.560
More about you, Lady Saint.

16:14.330 --> 16:16.150
Will you tell me?

16:18.030 --> 16:19.620
Yes.

16:20.430 --> 16:21.860
For lady saints,

16:21.860 --> 16:26.250
there are moments when we hear God's voice 
and receive divine revelation.

16:26.250 --> 16:27.720
For me,

16:27.720 --> 16:31.200
when I was so young that I may or 
may not have been aware of my surroundings,

16:31.630 --> 16:35.090
God's voice resounded in my mind.

16:35.090 --> 16:38.960
I suddenly loved all people, 
and I wanted to save them.

16:38.960 --> 16:42.320
Inside me, the whole world 
changed in an instant.

16:42.950 --> 16:46.920
Ever since then, I've been a lady saint.

16:47.920 --> 16:51.940
And then, when I was old enough 
that I conscious of the world around me,

16:52.240 --> 16:55.980
I lived with my grandmother 
in a house tucked away in the woods,

16:55.980 --> 16:58.320
just the two of us.

16:58.320 --> 17:03.330
My grandmother taught me everything I needed 
to know about being a lady saint.

17:03.330 --> 17:05.330
She gave me so much love.

17:05.680 --> 17:09.080
I think the days we spent together 
were very peaceful.

17:09.080 --> 17:10.880
Then, one day...

17:12.760 --> 17:14.710
Grandmother?

17:15.040 --> 17:17.480
...my grandmother passed away.

17:18.990 --> 17:22.980
On the night of that day, 
when I became all alone...

17:23.920 --> 17:26.240
I had a dream.

17:36.660 --> 17:38.160
Oh, no!

17:45.560 --> 17:47.040
That dream...

17:47.360 --> 17:50.640
told me of my duty as a lady saint.

17:53.040 --> 17:55.560
In order to save the people of that village,

17:55.560 --> 17:57.310
I left the forest.

17:58.920 --> 18:01.550
And so I told everyone.

18:01.550 --> 18:03.860
"Soon there will be heavy rains."

18:03.860 --> 18:07.820
"If this bridge isn't destroyed, 
the village will flood."

18:07.820 --> 18:08.560
I told them...

18:09.800 --> 18:10.750
but...

18:11.190 --> 18:16.100
I couldn't convince anyone, and 
I was nearing the end of my strength.

18:16.100 --> 18:17.590
That's when...

18:25.480 --> 18:27.600
I met you.

18:28.770 --> 18:29.960
Pastor?

18:29.960 --> 18:31.630
Destroy the bridge?

18:31.630 --> 18:33.460
That isn't something 
that can be easily done.

18:33.460 --> 18:36.010
And, a lady saint?

18:36.930 --> 18:39.320
My grandfather, Pastor Oswell,

18:39.320 --> 18:43.310
had one teaching he wanted me 
to preserve above all others.

18:43.310 --> 18:44.750
Mister Oswell did?

18:44.750 --> 18:45.810
Yes.

18:46.100 --> 18:48.960
He said that lady saints protect the people,

18:48.960 --> 18:53.970
but that's only possible 
because we protect them, too.

18:54.400 --> 18:58.490
My grandfather continued to tell me 
that right up until the end.

18:58.490 --> 19:01.250
I want to put my trust in him 
and in the lady saint,

19:01.250 --> 19:03.360
someone he wished to protect.

19:03.360 --> 19:06.760
When it comes to this bridge, 
if nothing happens,

19:06.760 --> 19:08.880
I'll take responsibility for it.

19:08.880 --> 19:14.430
So please, won't you take the lady 
saint's words under serious consideration?

19:15.800 --> 19:18.260
Well, if it's one of 
Mister Oswell's teachings,

19:18.260 --> 19:21.020
then we villagers have to follow it, right?

19:21.020 --> 19:22.070
That's true.

19:22.070 --> 19:25.670
We can't make young Lawrence shoulder all 
the responsibility, can we?

19:25.670 --> 19:27.110
Everyone...

19:27.110 --> 19:29.550
Th-Thank you so much!

19:30.660 --> 19:32.810
Being believed...

19:32.810 --> 19:34.820
it makes me feel a little relieved.

19:34.820 --> 19:36.320
How about you, Lady Saint?

19:38.320 --> 19:40.800
Y-Yes!

19:42.840 --> 19:46.790
Back then, it was you who found me, Lawren.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.080
Found you?

19:48.080 --> 19:52.960
The first person to believe 
that I was a lady saint was you, Lawren.

19:54.460 --> 19:56.060
Was I?

19:56.060 --> 19:57.240
Yes!

19:57.240 --> 20:00.600
And after coming here to live with you,

20:00.600 --> 20:02.910
I'm not lonely anymore.

20:02.910 --> 20:03.720
What?

20:03.720 --> 20:08.770
Living with my grandmother 
when I was a child, I was very happy,

20:08.770 --> 20:13.720
but my grandmother wasn't always home, 
so I was lonely sometimes.

20:13.880 --> 20:19.400
That's why, getting to live with you, 
Lawren, makes me very happy.

20:21.900 --> 20:24.990
I was alone, too.

20:24.990 --> 20:27.160
After my grandfather died.

20:28.270 --> 20:31.660
Hazelita said something to me before.

20:32.100 --> 20:33.540
It is, of course,

20:33.540 --> 20:38.290
because I want every lady saint 
to find happiness as a woman, too.

20:38.750 --> 20:40.540
Happiness...

20:40.540 --> 20:44.320
I am very happy, Lawren.

20:44.320 --> 20:45.670
Lawren, are you...

20:51.790 --> 20:54.960
The stars are beautiful, aren't they?

20:54.960 --> 20:56.120
Yes.

20:58.210 --> 21:02.690
<i>The lady saint thinks 
of herself as happy here.</i>

21:04.480 --> 21:05.700
<i>So am I.</i>

21:06.710 --> 21:11.320
<i>This irreplaceable time we spend 
together, I hope it goes on for—</i>

21:17.110 --> 21:18.860
Shall we head back down?

21:18.860 --> 21:20.800
I'm sorry to keep you so late.

21:23.800 --> 21:24.800
Huh?

21:25.630 --> 21:28.680
Lawren, your hands are so warm, aren't they?

21:30.780 --> 21:33.050
Your blankets will be even warmer!

21:33.450 --> 21:35.830
Please go ahead and go down first.

21:35.830 --> 21:37.070
Thank you.

21:37.070 --> 21:38.960
Good night.

21:38.960 --> 21:40.440
Good night.

21:47.570 --> 21:52.080
<i>I need the lady saint, 
and I want to be together forever.</i>

21:52.820 --> 21:56.080
<i>If the lady saint ever felt 
the same way, then...</i>

21:59.110 --> 22:02.440
What is it? What is this feeling?

23:22.630 --> 23:25.380
This is from a little before Cecilia arrived.

23:33.640 --> 23:36.190
I've made too much again.

23:36.950 --> 23:39.250
I won't be able to eat all of this alone.
